      "en": ": I felt the urge to go for a walk all of a sudden.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I've never been good at sleeping.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A walk at 3 AM? Are you insane?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene callous18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/callous18.webp",
      "alt": "callous18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re the one just creepily standing around in a girls’ dormitory in the middle of the night.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please don’t accuse me of being the insane one.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can you at least tell me where you’re going so if you’re murdered, I can give the police some info?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene callous17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/callous17.webp",
      "alt": "callous17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You should probably just come with me, to be honest.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": As much as I hate inviting you places, where I'm going is on the way to your house and it would probably be best if you didn’t spend the rest of the night just standing here.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re lucky it was me who found you and not anyone else.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Come.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s not far from here.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maya grabs my wrist and forces me to follow her.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She lets go shortly after. I’m pretty sure she just wanted to make sure my legs weren’t frozen in place or something along those lines.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene nightsky",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/nightsky.png",
      "alt": "nightsky"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I forget where I am halfway through the trip.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I forget that I’m anywhere to begin with.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I just focus on the stars and let the sound of the footsteps of the girl in front of me guide the way.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is as far as I come.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene callous19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/callous19.webp",
      "alt": "callous19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "We come to a stop in front of a tree positioned in the middle of three spotlights.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It’s not a particularly interesting tree or anything like that, so I’m a little confused as to why it’s been so carefully illuminated.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is this?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A tree, idiot.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, like...what is this?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you mean?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean why would you decide to come here of all places in the middle of the night?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene callous20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/callous20.webp",
      "alt": "callous20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why does anyone decide anything?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You know better than me that, sometimes, people decide to act out things without any logic or reason behind them.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is visiting a strange tree truly peculiar enough to warrant asking that question?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kind of. I think.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t really know.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re weird.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene callous21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/callous21.webp",
      "alt": "callous21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There is no beauty without some strangeness in its proportion.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Edgar Allan Poe.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Correct.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Some of the most beautiful things in life also happen to be the strangest.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is this you trying to get me to call you beautiful? Because I normally get in trouble for that.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene callous20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/callous20.webp",
      "alt": "callous20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Absolutely not. Anything but that.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maya moves over toward a snow-white cat basking in what little warmth one of the spotlights has to offer.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It isn’t until just then that I realize it’s begun to snow.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "When did it become this cold?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene callous22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/callous22.webp",
      "alt": "callous22"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re hungry, aren’t you?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sorry, but I don’t have any food for you.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The strange man over there may be willing to lend you money so you can go out and buy dinner, though.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hey...You do realize it’s snowing, don’t you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Obviously. I’m not an idiot.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You don’t think that’s strange?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course it’s strange. But so is the fact that there is a tree positioned between three spotlights next to an abandoned[school] building.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Abandoned[school] building? Is that where we are right now?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s one thing you could call it.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But it’s many other things as well.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m not sure if I follow.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you familiar with the stations of the cross?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Uhh, not really...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, the easiest way to summarize it would be that there are three gods, but also only one god.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How is that easy? That doesn’t make any sense at all.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome to religion.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The idea is that the cross is made up of three parts: The father, the son, and the holy spirit.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But those three things are of one body and make up who the Christians call “God.”",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, when you pray, you’re praying to not only one but three Gods. But also one. It’s odd.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, this is one of the many reasons I don’t get involved with religion.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I can understand why. A person with your limited mental capacity wouldn’t be able to grasp such a confusing concept.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You say that as if it’s something you can actually grasp.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You can not grasp what isn’t real.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Three gods is far too many.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Two gods is also too many.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And so is one.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I wish they’d all just go away.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "There’s a faint sadness in her voice that leaves with the wind as it sweeps through the courtyard.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "The snow-white cat darts away in fear as soon as the branches of the tree beside us start to rustle.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Maya does not frown or chase after it.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "She simply stands up and walks over to me.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Then she closes her eyes.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "And says this-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": God is dead.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So we’ll never have to worry about three all at once.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But, if for some strange reason, one day we do-",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I hope that you will choose the least callous of them.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "//ERROR",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "//GOD IS NOT DEAD",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "//GOD IS ALIVE AND WELL",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "//HE RISES",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "//SLEEPS AMONG US",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "//RAPES THE ONES WE LOVE",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "//WE MUST WATCH AS OUR DREAMS ARE DESECRATED",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "//PRAISE BE",
      "zh": ""
    },
